### ==============================================================================
### FRESHFLOW ERP — REST API TEST BENCH
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8005/api
@contentType = application/json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SYSTEM HEALTH & LIVENESS PROBE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Health Check Probe
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/
Accept: {{contentType}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. AUTHENTICATION & JWT TOKEN ROTATION
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Authenticate as System Administrator (অ্যাডমিনিস্ট্রেটর লগইন)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin_demo",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Capture Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}
@adminRefresh = {{loginAdmin.response.body.refresh}}


### 2.2 Authenticate as Warehouse Manager (কোল্ড-স্টোরেজ গুদাম ব্যবস্থাপক)
# @name loginWarehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "warehouse_demo",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Capture Warehouse Manager Token
@warehouseToken = {{loginWarehouse.response.body.access}}


### 2.3 Authenticate as Sales Representative (বিক্রয় ও বিপণন প্রতিনিধি)
# @name loginSales
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "sales_demo",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Capture Sales Token
@salesToken = {{loginSales.response.body.access}}


### 2.4 Authenticate as Restaurant Partner - Bistro Chef (রেস্টুরেন্ট ক্লায়েন্ট লগইন)
# @name loginClient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "bistro_chef",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### Capture Client Token
@clientToken = {{loginClient.response.body.access}}


### 2.5 Single-Use Refresh Token Rotation Check
# @name refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token/refresh/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh": "{{adminRefresh}}"
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. INVENTORY CATALOG (তাজা ও পচনশীল খাদ্য তালিকা)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 List All Perishable Catalog Items
# @name listItems
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 3.2 Add পদ্মা নদীর তাজা রূপালী ইলিশ (Padma Fresh Hilsa)
# @name createHilsaItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "পদ্মা নদীর তাজা রূপালী ইলিশ (Padma Hilsa Fish)",
  "category": "SEAFOOD",
  "required_temp_celsius": -2.00,
  "temp_tolerance_celsius": 1.00,
  "standard_shelf_life_days": 14,
  "unit_of_measure": "kg"
}


### 3.3 Add বগুড়ার ঐতিহ্যবাহী স্পেশাল মিষ্টি দই (Bogura Premium Curd)
# @name createBoguraCurdItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "বগুড়ার ঐতিহ্যবাহী মিষ্টি দই (Bogura Special Curd)",
  "category": "DAIRY",
  "required_temp_celsius": 2.00,
  "temp_tolerance_celsius": 1.00,
  "standard_shelf_life_days": 10,
  "unit_of_measure": "pot"
}


### 3.4 Add চট্টগ্রামের তাজা গরুর মাংস (Chittagong Fresh Beef)
# @name createChittagongBeefItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "চট্টগ্রামের তাজা গরুর মাংস (Chittagong Fresh Beef)",
  "category": "MEAT_POULTRY",
  "required_temp_celsius": -18.00,
  "temp_tolerance_celsius": 1.50,
  "standard_shelf_life_days": 45,
  "unit_of_measure": "kg"
}


### 3.5 Add সাভার ডেইরি তাজা গরুর খাঁটি দুধ (Savar Fresh Cow Milk)
# @name createSavarMilkItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "সাভার ডেইরি তাজা খাঁটি দুধ (Savar Fresh Cow Milk)",
  "category": "DAIRY",
  "required_temp_celsius": 3.00,
  "temp_tolerance_celsius": 0.50,
  "standard_shelf_life_days": 4,
  "unit_of_measure": "liter"
}


### 3.6 Add মুন্সিগঞ্জের ডায়মন্ড আলু (Munshiganj Diamond Potatoes)
# @name createMunshiganjPotatoItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/items/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "মুন্সিগঞ্জের ডায়মন্ড আলু (Munshiganj Fresh Potatoes)",
  "category": "PRODUCE",
  "required_temp_celsius": 12.00,
  "temp_tolerance_celsius": 2.00,
  "standard_shelf_life_days": 60,
  "unit_of_measure": "kg"
}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. COLD STORAGE BATCHES (কোল্ড চেইন লট ও গুদাম ইনটেক)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 List Active Batches with Shelf-Life Countdowns
# @name listBatches
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/batches/
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 4.2 Intake Batch: Padma Hilsa Lot #1 (Expiring Soon - FEFO Priority)
# @name intakeHilsaBatch1
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/batches/
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "batch_number": "PADMA-HILSA-LOT-2025-01",
  "item": 1,
  "harvest_pack_date": "2025-01-20",
  "expiry_date": "2025-01-27",
  "initial_quantity": "50.00",
  "current_quantity": "50.00",
  "purchase_cost": "1450.00",
  "base_selling_price": "1750.00",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "storage_bin": "FREEZER-PADMA-A1"
}


