# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. CRM & B2B RESTAURANT CLIENTS (রেস্টুরেন্ট পার্টনার ও লয়ালটি টায়ার)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 List All Registered Dining Establishments
# @name listRestaurants
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/restaurants/
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 5.2 Register Bengali Restaurant: কস্তুরী রেস্টুরেন্ট (Kasturi Restaurant - Purana Paltan)
# @name registerKasturi
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/restaurants/
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "business_name": "কস্তুরী রেস্টুরেন্ট (Kasturi Restaurant - Purana Paltan)",
  "trade_license_no": "TRAD-DHAKA-PALTAN-449102",
  "user": 4,
  "tier": "GOLD",
  "total_spent_last_3_months": "620000.00",
  "credit_limit": "200000.00"
}


### 5.3 Register Bengali Restaurant: স্টার কাবাব ও রেস্টুরেন্ট (Star Kabab - Dhanmondi 2)
# @name registerStarKabab
POST {{baseUrl}}/crm/restaurants/
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "business_name": "স্টার কাবাব ও রেস্টুরেন্ট (Star Kabab - Dhanmondi)",
  "trade_license_no": "TRAD-DHAKA-DHAN-983144",
  "user": 1,
  "tier": "PLATINUM",
  "total_spent_last_3_months": "1250000.00",
  "credit_limit": "500000.00"
}


### 5.4 Check Restaurant Tier Discount Status
# @name checkKasturiTier
GET {{baseUrl}}/crm/restaurants/1/tier/
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. ATOMIC FEFO ORDER DISPATCH (ফার্স্ট-এক্সপায়ার্ড, ফার্স্ট-আউট অর্ডার ডেলিভারি)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Place B2B Multi-Item Order (Executes Database Row Locking & Greedy Batch Picking)
# If ordering 60kg of Padma Hilsa, FEFO picks 50kg from LOT-2025-01 (Jan 27) + 10kg from LOT-2025-02 (Feb 05).
# Gold Tier applies 7% dynamic discount on profit margin automatically.
# @name submitFefoOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": 1,
      "quantity": "60.00"
    }
  ]
}


### 6.2 Sales Agent Placing Assisted Order on Behalf of Kasturi Restaurant
# @name submitSalesOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": 1,
      "quantity": "15.00"
    }
  ]
}


### 6.3 List All Fulfilled and Allocated Orders
# @name listOrders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 6.4 Inspect Detailed Order Breakdown (Line Items & Allocated Batches)
# @name getOrderDetail
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. WASTAGE & FINANCIAL SCRAP LOSS (নষ্ট ও মেয়াদোত্তীর্ণ পণ্যের হিসাব)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Log Spoilage Write-Off with Cold Chain Breach Root-Cause
# @name logWastage
POST {{baseUrl}}/wastage/scrap/
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "batch": 1,
  "quantity_lost": "5.00",
  "financial_loss": "7250.00",
  "reason": "COLD_CHAIN_BREACH"
}


### 7.2 List Wastage and Loss Logs
# @name listWastageLogs
GET {{baseUrl}}/wastage/logs/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. EXECUTIVE ANALYTICS & COLD-CHAIN TELEMETRY (ব্যবসায়িক অ্যানালিটিক্স)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Executive Top-Line KPIs Aggregation
# @name getExecutiveKpis
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/kpis/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 8.2 Supplier Quality and Spoilage Rate Matrix
# @name getSupplierSpoilage
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/supplier-spoilage/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9. EMPLOYEE PROFILE & SECURITY AUDIT TRAIL (কর্মচারী প্রোফাইল ও অডিট লগ)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9.1 Get Current Authenticated Employee Profile (নিজের প্রোফাইল দেখুন)
# @name getMyProfile
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 9.2 Update Personal Profile Information (ব্যক্তিগত তথ্য হালনাগাদ)
# @name updateMyProfile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "personal_phone": "+880 1712 998877",
  "address": "বাড়ি নং ১২, রোড নং ৪, ধানমন্ডি আ/এ, ঢাকা ১২০৫, বাংলাদেশ",
  "emergency_contact_name": "নুসরাত জাহান (Nusrat Jahan)",
  "emergency_contact_phone": "+880 1811 223344",
  "preferred_language": "বাংলা, English"
}


### 9.3 Get Personal Activity Audit Trail (সাম্প্রতিক সিকিউরিটি অ্যাক্টিভিটি)
# @name getMyActivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/me/activity/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 9.4 Get Corporate Reporting Hierarchy Structure (রিপোর্টিং লাইন)
# @name getReportingStructure
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/me/reporting-structure/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 9.5 Administrator: List All Corporate Departments
# @name listDepartments
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/departments/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### 9.6 Administrator: Global Immutable Audit Trail Log
# @name listAuditLogs
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/audit-logs/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}
